# Insane Marketing Studio: your API keys. This file lives outside every project and is never committed.
# Paste each key after its = sign (no spaces, no quotes), save and close. Leave a line empty if you don't have that account.
# Never paste a key into a chat, a script, a commit or a Slack message. A key that leaked is burned: revoke it and make a new one.

# ElevenLabs (voice, music, sound effects, Scribe). elevenlabs.io → Developers → API keys → Create.
# Give it access to: Text to Speech, Sound Effects, Music, Speech to Text, Voices (read). Set a credit limit.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Higgsfield (Seedance 2.5 video clips). Only if your video needs generated footage. cloud.higgsfield.ai → API keys.
# Paste it as  <key id>:<secret>
HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter (optional fallback for Seedance; refuses photoreal people). openrouter.ai → Keys. Set a spend limit.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
